  <item>
    <title>11 友雅：从“中国最美的书”设计师到纽约ADC奖评委</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68afe46a97178f08ee0e1b21</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68afe46a97178f08ee0e1b21</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 08:09:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：友雅（李让）</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍设计师,插图画家</span></p><span></span><p><span>友雅设计的《失物之书》和《中国童谣翻翻乐》曾被评为“中国最美的书”，而且《中国童谣翻翻乐》还在国际上收获了纽约ADC的最佳出版物设计奖和英国D&amp;AD的“木铅笔奖”。因为目前生活在瑞典，她很少和国内的朋友分享创作感受。这一次，我们就一起来揭秘最美的书背后的创作故事和她对于国际书籍设计行业的观察。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> 为什么选择书籍设计这个专业方向？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 书籍设计+插画是我擅长的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">08:32</a> “中国最美的书”《失物之书》的创作故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> “中国最美的书”《中国童谣翻翻乐》的创作故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 立体书：不只是形式的立体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> 纸张选择的巧思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1453">24:13</a> 从设计到出版的艰难过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">26:37</a> 《中国童谣翻翻乐》在国际上获奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1818">30:18</a> 童书市场的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a> 在纽约ADC做评委</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> 对北欧书籍设计的观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2794">46:34</a> 立体书形式的奖状设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3012">50:12</a> 两个独立创作的项目，期待有机会出版</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3398">56:38</a> 回顾作品，满意与遗憾</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmHjbu75c8Hh4FYlq7CQ-WJvHMKE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkRrklZ7evOadhHWmwVhEvEF8GQ7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>早期作品《芒果街上的小屋》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiZcWlyDUyKoBe_LGwDVwVACaTRu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmBV2UHcGP52WM01aAr5dZbvoC53.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu0hr4FxX0Xq_UNDo6GVg-af7bUs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《失物之书》，获评2009年“中国最美的书”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMZhdml9Cl9UdSua-FaunZBKfh5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《中国童谣翻翻乐》套装，2022“中国最美的书”；第102届纽约ADC“最佳出版物设计奖”（金奖），“书籍类金奖”；2023英国D&amp;AD“木铅笔奖”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhjBB8hcud78kfhIur_itYiWl4mm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtOzxFgyV2KJrhWRX4TXjyMDr3JS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkenS_BrAEQ7WfsNWTKuXUPOBN3w.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《中国童谣翻翻乐》之《孙悟空打妖怪》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FviXP7S9PNk-NBCo3Lcgs_OAHS-F.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn5J5DTeRBuWvDbmnzjewQ6i0Y2k.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FppcXWHyoECDyGXwOn7pzYlOwc6p.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《中国童谣翻翻乐》之《虎和兔》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlabyklU2QRij9z4eaf6XxM_BZcj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhZNAYt6CWXI-EKR24K0cbQakB5Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《中国童谣翻翻乐》之《正月梅花香又香》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv868Bb6c4TqLlEOBzih8NJTdRb9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiCogyj1Y5_EbB1JqN5AkItmji4Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《中国童谣翻翻乐》之《一园青菜成了精》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBRqaBTCUOz-I5jFlXE_zqqWJIA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《中国童谣翻翻乐》其他作品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpw9bXJp3ZdysPFyZiJfDFZwK_-s.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs0PEFltnkd0s1ZDkV6Rdi3QHyUh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《给妈妈的一百万封信》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FieuzIq7THvSuufPmNew8WT5qrpj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>独立创作，关于北欧的书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlxHm3kBCYwkK2uyJ2wLiUYfKIRj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlQLTUhprUntSDTqiS5HBXXXSKof.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>独立创作，小猫绘本</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎订阅、评论、转发。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6675743bc75701acdeaea0f2/lr-633W4bDHW4Igc3U5OiDNk_Tiu.m4a" length="59149202" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgbJy86u8-Urqq-a4_JV5_-cS0Yp.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>10 女书字体：跨学科、数字化，女性之间的隐秘文字如何登上国际舞台</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68492bdf1c45a63232a16a49</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68492bdf1c45a63232a16a49</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jun 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>刘钊</span></strong><span>，中央美术学院副教授</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>姜兆勤</span></strong><span>，中科院软件所工程师</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我邀请到的两位嘉宾是谷歌noto女书字体家族的主创，他们以跨学科的视角和方式，探索了语言文字的设计路径和协作模式，为此后的相关文化创意和研究打下了基础，也以数字化的方式为女书习俗这一国家级非遗的研究和保护做出了贡献。这套字体曾在2021年获得了D&amp;AD 的木铅笔奖，并在多个国内外大型展览中得到了展出。</span></p><span></span><p><span>该套字体为开源字体，有需要的朋友可以在Google Fonts和Github官方平台下载使用。</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头音乐：何艳新《上位歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐：周荆儿《金陀女》</span></p><span></span><p><span>提及电影：《雪花秘扇》（2011）</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关文章：刘 钊、姜兆勤《回到未来——女书字体设计研究与字库开发》（2023）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk9TJPXPRrOwVGB42Nj7n6_8CmG2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>团队在湖南江永调研</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtRf7ERI_HQCtNaX6CxJzZhRkZ-F.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>团队在湖南江永调研</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiiaD9c3K-oPHoNKBNWILfG0v3gt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>团队拜访何艳新女士，请她按照女书标准字符集书写女字</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhxMATafGfSjFAY-mJu9AaGzcgTP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>女书文献字形索引（节选）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>以下为本套字体设计的图片</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjCyihkzmnvwDRNAjIZd3yp63uHH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNeXAL5gT7vjAN_uiJXF6dDXPG5.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmozaDli-vdWeeekHWIhus0Bh7bu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhf4xPp0V4THE7AmU6XImSsplT7r.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlIHhD_KKIdxE7TZcb8rQ8Lq5iXZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flz6Xs3dnvHfzBwp2lOAecTTd5rZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv7DwjTmECXoKOcmQJUj4RExAHtm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjMKKXcPxbteqCgVP_VNMiha8sxV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 谷歌Noto女书字体家族项目的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 什么是国际编码字符集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">05:28</a> 此前对于女书的了解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> 女书的国际编码——女书字体设计工作的基础</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a> 在江永当地对女书使用情况的考察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 住在谭盾先生的同款房间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">18:28</a> 学科交叉：女书字体设计的跨学科特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1386">23:06</a> 女书字体的设计与一般的字体设计有何区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 女书“传统体”，为什么不是毛笔书写风格？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a> 发现国际编码中的问题，但话语权不在中国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> 瘦长、有倾角、笔顺不一，女书设计的多种挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">42:28</a> 怎样解决女书超框撞笔的问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2927">48:47</a> 女书字体的应用场景（开源），下载平台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3162">52:42</a> 女书字体设计的意义与价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3654">60:54</a> 全球范围内，土著与濒危文字数字化的趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4015">66:55</a> 让儿童爱上甲骨文，甲骨文绘本项目</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢本期节目，欢迎订阅、评论、转发。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6675743bc75701acdeaea0f2/ljJe9le8NUo_iGagFH--90jte4wy.m4a" length="75249647" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjikIJ0Kt236DtijZptGJ13W-4yQ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>09 技术迭代、江湖字流行，如何看待字体设计的今天和明天？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683915fb38dcc57c64b2c612</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683915fb38dcc57c64b2c612</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 02:29:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：</span><strong><span>郭毓海</span></strong><span>，方正字库字体设计师，清华大学美术学院设计学博士</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;前一段时间，邱志杰老师对于国内字体问题的观点引起了很多的关注和讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，专业的字体设计师如何看待字体设计，字体与文化的关系，字体与技术的关系呢？本期嘉宾，来自方正字库的设计师郭毓海，与我们分享了他的观点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>郭毓海本硕博分别攻读自动化、书法与设计学，参与了方正“中华字库精品工程”赵孟頫行书体、吴玉如行书体，鲁迅体、牛黑可变体等的设计工作，其中牛黑可变体是目前可变轴最多的量产字库产品。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关链接：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.foundertype.com/index.php/Provider/index/id/25.html" data-url="https://www.foundertype.com/index.php/Provider/index/id/25.html"><span>方正“中华字库精品工程”</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.foundertype.com/index.php/FindFont/searchFont?keyword=%E7%89%9B%E9%BB%91%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%98%E4%BD%93" data-url="https://www.foundertype.com/index.php/FindFont/searchFont?keyword=%E7%89%9B%E9%BB%91%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%98%E4%BD%93"><span>方正牛黑可变体</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tcMdW7R29U6tNUkGXkNGCQ?token=506061164&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tcMdW7R29U6tNUkGXkNGCQ?token=506061164&amp;lang=zh_CN"><span>方正字体趋势报告</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqihSCWXdm9L0PgJyadE1o_GwNIh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>赵健：《范式革命：中国现代书籍设计的发端（1862—1937）》，牛黑可变体的灵感来源之一</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj_u_zu1z2qSFBa0k5igfrN8g7Qg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FomCpf1TozbCLtJZ7DhIBlwfyajQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>方正牛黑可变体</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBe8-PSnWyazUyFWJUiVVvG-r_T.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>方正赵孟頫行书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtPwV2yqsLtnebg0R6nhNljY02K-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>方正吴玉如行书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnsKpGzZ8scbwyaJbUKHt4B1pHsk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>方正鲁迅体</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnVBOgH5IfOiSTk0gPOC1rlIy9H9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>方正字体趋势报告整理的字体风格趋势</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 时间戳 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 成熟的字体设计师为什么要读博士？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a> 设计牛黑可变体，是为了验证字体设计数学化的可能性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 参数化的字体设计与书法字体的设计有什么差异？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 直线、曲线组合的字体借鉴了哪些设计？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> 可变轴最多的字库产品，是设计师自己写代码实现的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 小科普：字体设计中的参数化设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> 人工智能在字体设计中能做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> 字库公司就像开超市的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 技术提效：一个月完成“拼积木”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 字体设计为什么非要创新？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 如何看待邱志杰抨击的“江湖字”“武士道字体”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2059">34:19</a> 如何评价李白的书法？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 西方的装饰主义VS中国的表现主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a> 方正字库最珍贵的团队是哪个？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2649">44:09</a> 他们的眼睛就是一把尺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2912">48:32</a> 技术迭代后，设计师的核心能力也变了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3265">54:25</a> 治愈系当道，现在市场需求的字体有哪些趋势？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6675743bc75701acdeaea0f2/lhZ3zcRZotqT3TsBQ2Ji6AE5aK_V.m4a" length="61148458" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkWYdTmfnvXM7cxJgzMQndib5mm0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>08 没有展品的博物馆，如何讲出好故事？对话李德庚</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fdfd74cdd692da1567ea2c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fdfd74cdd692da1567ea2c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：</span><strong><span>李德庚，清华大学美术学院副教授，博士生导师。直径叙事创始人、艺术学博士。</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>没有展品的博物馆，怎么策展和设计？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>历史人物故事，如何吸引当代人？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>限制性条件，设计师为什么喜欢？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>博物馆变成网红打卡地，设计师怎么看？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>他带领直径叙事的团队，专注于博物馆、企业馆、美术馆等展览的叙事设计与城市文化空间创新。它们所做的设计，跳脱出一般的展览策划与展陈设计，把策展与叙事融为一体，成为一个个融合了空间、人与想象的作品。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你所在的城市有他们的设计作品，一定要去现场体验一下～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 平面设计师为什么被空间吸引？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 什么是空间叙事？和展陈设计有什么不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> 张之洞与武汉博物馆，没有展品的难题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 历史与当代人有什么关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1376">22:56</a> 张之洞的故事如何重新讲述？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">26:38</a> 特殊的空间，激发设计师特殊的反映</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 改革者的孤独，如何通过空间表达？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a> 无知者无畏VS沉稳老练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a> 编织进社区中的博物馆群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2615">43:35</a> 创作者“别太把自己当回事儿”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2918">48:38</a> 既不反对打卡，也不追求打卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3289">54:49</a> 没有展柜的展览空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3618">60:18</a> 味觉看不见，怎么展示？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> 把展览作为作品，前期工作有多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4205">70:05</a> 选择甲方，主要看人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4603">76:43</a> 重新思考展览是什么</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvnsSKJfXXPAwslMqBUgi34kTbJY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>张之洞与武汉博物馆，获第14届美国国际设计大奖（简称IDA）Interior Design-Museum, Exhibits, Pavilions and exhibitions 类别金奖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhT4fiGcQlIrl5fV32tZFMGpqysn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>张之洞与武汉博物馆的两个当代话题</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5SJe7cj8d5IEBk3B2zfvMZlBqI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“京汉铁路行程环”展区</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoOTNob6g66x9GC4Bz-Cu-RjyIN9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“中西结合的近代学堂教育”展区</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FharoIvSyntJ9j6ibZ_-O-rbYFlI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“张之洞的智库”展区</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu0bu587b6OUV2q_QidS2PsyVL2i.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“改革之的孤独”展区</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq1-GCX_Hc28hZtUFKcpCfI9d4bf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>深圳南头古城的同源馆 外部参观效果图。获2024美国IDA国际设计奖室内设计类别银奖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgo52dePWTuxpzutjtUW1o791zPq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>同源馆-经济同体馆-从报德广场看向馆内</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkGYeTFduf8dnu1fiWxEDQ3Dci7f.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>同源馆-经济同体馆的蓝色楼梯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FspUI_UIeP1NI7D-Y6iPugV-DDS2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>同源馆-山海同面貌馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmSVFHFdFte5yq69X8t2oxUDXlRr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>味觉博物馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlU558LQ3i57RpWqdP7zosXGQ4vn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>味觉表情视频截图</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6675743bc75701acdeaea0f2/lgvvXS5ZP3jATM3_vA-c-l-pCLl_.m4a" length="117842401" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:21:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvk2WbglVgwjudV94at9x9DQZ-Pf.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>07 千年前的陶瓷工艺，因为情绪价值在市集焕发生机</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e25ed0dd11f9c8c1fb4329</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e25ed0dd11f9c8c1fb4329</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期的嘉宾杨文杰，曾经在无印良品作过设计师，现在是一位日用陶瓷的创作者。他用设计的方法，让千年前的陶瓷工艺绞胎在今天重新被大家认识、使用和喜欢，在节目中，他也分享了很多在深圳参与市集的经历和思考，如果你也对手工艺、对参与市集感兴趣，那就一定不要错过这一期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：曲直间</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>唐宋时代的陶瓷工艺，在今天有了马卡龙色</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>手工艺可以提供情绪价值，放松身心</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小红书小眼睛95万，是因为看错了？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>出市集一天过万是真是假？市集避坑指南</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>无印良品的设计经验，用在市集摊位布置上</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvGmBWqh72wu4ROaHUPQ3zzrvqsJ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>颜色试片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhHVcQ5t75bjwe_0-suYOfAqNRJJ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>制作过程</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FirrseIPFZ79s2dvCFyMRMU3KIf5.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>制作过程</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkLOFDeJOxMYMrYN1YpvPpaeO1T4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fugb6caw3-XQr_8x2jlDrJ8LYRf-.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>金奖作品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lheBgS359mxlJ1ALk6IuvdvNgKes.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnKZz4Ci1eq08Co5w72p8AmU5dX8.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lg6NYMJR0ZygfnM1OK9x6PP6dc5E.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh65KnkxB1CDt1GBXwIRYFErUFs7.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luegvxL02Oy4KDlxAIEL42tW3E7J.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs0pgJizNnuo6MgjaPperBoVTTxV.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvY-U59zz1_YknShqkCtfpOya6Zh.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>各类产品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgAiq27JSThXY5nB8cxEvoDuq_jB.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmaSoZy3l33T9_e80cwQwH8A_Y8M.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>参与市集</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a>做陶瓷创作需要哪些条件？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> 什么是绞胎？绞胎的魅力在于什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="747">12:27</a> 现代材料，让绞胎产品有了马卡龙色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> 竞争激烈，手工艺创意难不难？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 小红书95万浏览量的帖子，击中了情绪价值？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> 陶瓷的灵感来源是甜品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> 手工可以抚慰都市人的内心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1734">28:54</a>一天过万是真是假？市集摊主一般能卖多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a> 市集分三类，各有特色，各有门槛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2704">45:04</a> 出市集的额外收获，老板找我订制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2787">46:27</a> 市集摊位设计，无印良品的经验用起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3218">53:38</a> 参加市集，避雷提示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3473">57:53</a> 绞胎的设计流程；作品获金奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3642">60:42</a> 用产品思维做陶瓷；控制价格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4247">70:47</a> 市集遇到日本大客户，镂空的碗也买</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎订阅、评论、转发。我们下期见。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6675743bc75701acdeaea0f2/lkJUBj11OHXtJnydA7MGudzjGITi.m4a" length="73225043" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvGmT55_pnjSGmRRbOG4yC3I7tJ8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>06 手工艺产品卖得好，不是因为非遗和情怀？闲云夏布，让中国夏布不输日韩</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676e4a751e823e72d32cf62d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676e4a751e823e72d32cf62d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Dec 2024 06:44:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>夏布是什么 ？有什么特点？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>花费上百万开发高品质的夏布，值得吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>夏布产品卖得好，不是因为文化和情怀？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>传统手工艺的生命力表现在哪儿？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>设计客，带你了解真实的设计世界。我是某个远方。每期我会邀请设计师朋友，以访谈的形式分享设计经验，讲述成长故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期的嘉宾有点特别，四把刀不是一位设计师，但是却用一种传统的手工面料——夏布，开发出很多适用于当代生活的产品。他对于恢复高品质夏布的执着，让中国夏布不输日韩的经历，也很令人钦佩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢传统的手工艺，也许你也会喜欢闲云夏布的故事。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg5110ZmBUFDoYtTnUjvWt4O_vWt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>麻田</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkBKsN3kesFumLkb-2EhMHnmjoaD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>手工绩麻</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy8yNWI0LWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvMTgvM0IvR0FxaDFRUUxRLVZpQUFOdThnTkg0V3VzLmpwZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmZGV2aWNlX3R5cGU9aW9zJnVwbG9hZF90eXBlPWF0dGFjaG1lbnQmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>实体店内</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy85ZDU5LWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvQkUvOTcvR0FxaG50QUxRLVYzQUFPLWZnTkg0WEtILmpwZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmZGV2aWNlX3R5cGU9aW9zJnVwbG9hZF90eXBlPWF0dGFjaG1lbnQmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>在市集上售卖的夏布帽子</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy82YTRjLWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvQTIvQzQvR0FxaHA1MExRLVdZQUFOWk93Tkg0WDJGLmpwZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmZGV2aWNlX3R5cGU9aW9zJnVwbG9hZF90eXBlPWF0dGFjaG1lbnQmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>夏布拼帘</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy9hZDNmLWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvNjEvRkQvR0t3UklOc0xRLVdzQUFZSTBBTkg0WVRMLmpwZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmZGV2aWNlX3R5cGU9aW9zJnVwbG9hZF90eXBlPWF0dGFjaG1lbnQmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>夏布包包</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy9jMzgwLWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvQjYvRTkvR0FxaDlzQUxRLVc5QUFMQ1hRTkg0WXJ0LmpwZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmZGV2aWNlX3R5cGU9aW9zJnVwbG9hZF90eXBlPWF0dGFjaG1lbnQmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>夏布台灯和猫头鹰</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXYyLnhtY2RuLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlcy9iZWQ3LWF1ZGlvZnJlZWhpZ2hxcHMvMzgvODkvR0t3Uklhc0xRLVhiQUFMcl93Tkg0WmJpLmpwZyFvcF90eXBlPTQmZGV2aWNlX3R5cGU9aW9zJnVwbG9hZF90eXBlPWF0dGFjaG1lbnQmbmFtZT1tb2JpbGVfbGFyZ2U=.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>夏布上关于产地、手艺人的信息</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 时间戳 |</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 初识夏布</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">03:37</a> 什么是真正的夏布？与工厂产品差别在哪儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="341">05:41</a> 尝试用夏布做一切</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">07:53</a> 尝试恢复高品质的夏布：万载计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> 日本藏家，提示我也可以收藏夏布服饰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> 中国织不出好的夏布了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a> 合作人退出，独自前行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 210条的夏布，人类手工的极限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a> 中国的高品质夏布，不输日韩！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1716">28:36</a> 花费上百万织出高品质的夏布，资金哪里来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">30:46</a> 夏布产品怎么开发？有两种最受欢迎：帽子和拼帘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 消费者不是在消费情怀或非遗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a> 价格是一个相对的概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2498">41:38</a> 手工夏布有没有不可替代的地方？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2618">43:38</a> 小科普：成绩的“绩”字是从哪里来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">44:24</a> 夏布与环保，可以做咖啡滤网哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> 日本是一个麻的国度，夏布做和服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2978">49:38</a> 3000块一米的夏布卖给谁了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 非遗的传承与创新，传统手工艺代表着我们文化的根</span></p>]]></description>
