  <item>
    <title>02 不用打卡、没有班味儿，聊聊自由职业插画师的日常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f794b781cdab3a93a31e76</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f794b781cdab3a93a31e76</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Sep 2024 05:31:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>为了创作一本书就决定辞职了？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>做喜欢的事儿，赚快乐的钱是真的吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>不自律的人能做自由职业者吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>接到插画委托，签合同时有哪些避坑指南？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：自由职业者，绘本作者、插画师王静思。她创作插画的绘本《我们的大自然》豆瓣评分9.7，《小小的自然观察笔记》是小红书的爆款，已经加印了十余次。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书ID：9550993979</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnLME0xQfCrqkMYEaAnzC1JFHpES.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《乘上时光机，日本动漫小旅行》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm3EFkkZE4oTok-Qxkop_sfn_MPD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《我们的大自然》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft2p2ilhXqhCNG-XzIbmh4DaTYqS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsBP4H4EKolHntdEfEjHwekRotiH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《小小的自然观察笔记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 为什么绘本不能业余时间做，一定要辞职?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 第一本绘本曾卖到排行榜第三</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 自由职业者的工作机会来自哪儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 做喜欢的事儿，赚快乐的钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 对于时间的掌控和安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 我的一天怎么过？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> 自由职业者的社交困境和焦虑症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 小红书爆款《小小的自然观察笔记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2028">33:48</a> 科普类插画的创作特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2303">38:23</a> 第一次合作，有哪些避坑指南？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a> 版税怎么赚，赚多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2868">47:48</a> 自我追求和赚钱之间有矛盾怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3126">52:06</a> 接受未成年人的创作委托有风险</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq-kh5td7Y7O0SnlyYfvnz7WJAto.m4a" length="53831683" type="audio/mp4"/>
