  <item>
    <title>01 从百万设计费到日销一万单的文创日历，俗画说的爆品故事和踩坑故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e00313ee04007d88823d53</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e00313ee04007d88823d53</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Sep 2024 08:28:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>百万设计费的设计业务，为什么做腻了？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>日销一万单的爆款日历，是怎么设计出来的？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>屡屡获奖的节庆礼品，讲了哪些文化故事？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>为什么他劝设计师最好别创业？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾是俗画说的创始人胡永和，他的团队设计的节日礼品，屡获设计奖项，爆品日历一历解药，日销售量达到一万单。</span></p><span></span><p><span>胡老师很真诚地分享了这些成功案例背后的故事，也分享了他创业路上踩过的坑。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpIRITzU4wwyZ42Bvs9NpV9ElIE0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>爆款日历——一历解药</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWJ6P_kjjAlijuhGJScI9rz73Fr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>一历解药——招财猫日历</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvGOMSAAGJIps4YVbfQh1R5VQ7Qh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>赚钱日历</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuuYCH4BICGXGIb0G9A_l6a-kr-1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>端阳大吉 端午礼盒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp21VHXhoxxy9Bpa6ziSRZJkcpXa.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>云朵月饼礼盒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpv76396VveZsGudwn1l-7_0cXv6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>八方月饼礼盒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkNotmzWvYanKeFyYDvtTgIjNL2_.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>月饼地图</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 第一件产品就卖了一万套</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> 组建俗画说团队， 聚焦两类产品</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 日销一万单的爆款产品“一历解药”是怎么设计出来的？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 不做“痛点”做“痒点”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> “一历解药”的爆单时刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1414">23:34</a> 招财猫的概念日历，“赚钱日历”的问题复盘</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 香薰产品是怎么踩坑的？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 屡屡获奖、让“一条”主动找上门来的的节庆礼品设计</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 让人直接“哇噻”的创意</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 做产品的坑太多了……劝你别做</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3084">51:24</a> 未来值得期待的产品</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liak7voI2VO2wsd226e4QlvcD0dZ.m4a" length="78524193" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:04</itunes:duration>
